---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title={`Affiliate Disclosure | 10Best Living`} description={`10Best Living affiliate disclosure. We earn commissions from qualifying purchases to support our independent testing and reviews.`} path={`/affiliate-disclosure`}>
  <div class="bg-card">
    <div class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gradient-to-br from-cream via-cream-dark to-cream">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-primary mb-6 leading-tight">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
      <div class="prose-content text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary" data-aos="fade-up">
<h2 id="sec-1">Our Affiliate Relationships</h2>
<p>10Best Living participates in various affiliate marketing programs. This means we may earn commissions on qualifying purchases made through links to retailer websites on our site, including but not limited to Amazon.com.</p>

<h2 id="sec-2">How It Works</h2>
<p>When you click on an affiliate link and make a purchase, the retailer pays us a small commission (typically 3-10% of the purchase price). This comes at no extra cost to you — the price you pay is the same whether you use our link or go directly to the retailer.</p>

<h2 id="sec-3">Our Commitment to Independence</h2>
<p>Affiliate commissions do NOT influence our product rankings, reviews, or recommendations. Our editorial process is entirely independent:</p>
<ul>
<li>We purchase most products with our own funds</li>
<li>We test products objectively over extended periods</li>
<li>Our rankings are based solely on performance and value</li>
<li>We disclose affiliate relationships transparently</li>
</ul>
<p>We would rather recommend a lower-priced product than a higher-priced one that pays larger commissions. Your trust is our most valuable asset.</p>

<h2 id="sec-4">FTC Compliance</h2>
<p>In accordance with the Federal Trade Commission (FTC) guidelines, we clearly disclose our affiliate relationships throughout our website. This disclosure applies to all content published on 10bestliving.com.</p>

<h2 id="sec-5">Supporting Our Work</h2>
<p> Affiliate commissions help fund our product testing, research, and editorial operations. When you purchase through our links, you directly support our mission to provide honest, thorough product reviews.</p>
<p>Thank you for supporting 10Best Living!</p>
</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>


